{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-single-project-tsx","path":"/projects/the-dream-machine","result":{"data":{"project":{"Completed":"8 years ago","dateCompleted":"2018-09-01","Title":"The Dream Machine","RepoLink":null,"LiveLink":null,"skills":[],"Narrative":{"data":{"childMarkdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Doing installation work is one of my favorite things as an audio producer. Maybe it is from playing in bands my whole life. Either way, I helped collaborate with HP Innovation to create this gigantic masterpiece, debuted at New York City's \"Panorama Music Festival.\"</p>\n<p>We used Max for Live and Ableton all hidden away in the installation to drive the music and instrumentation. What started out with alot of frustrated hours of coding, ended with something truly magical. Watching people's faces when they interacted with the machine was very gratifying.</p>\n<p>I hope that I can continue work like this in the future.</p>"}}},"tags":[],"Cover":{"alternativeText":"dreamMachine.png","localFile":{"url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/sigman-public-assets/dream_Machine_1fd030608d/dream_Machine_1fd030608d.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"fullWidth","backgroundColor":"#180828","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/6424f1536b76c58a2d74eb67e64b8b8d/4cb8b/dream_Machine_1fd030608d.png","srcSet":"/static/6424f1536b76c58a2d74eb67e64b8b8d/4cb8b/dream_Machine_1fd030608d.png 490w","sizes":"100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/6424f1536b76c58a2d74eb67e64b8b8d/c53f1/dream_Machine_1fd030608d.webp 490w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"100vw"}]},"width":1,"height":0.8877551020408163},"fixed":{"base64":"data:image/png;base64,","width":400,"height":355,"src":"/static/6424f1536b76c58a2d74eb67e64b8b8d/497c6/dream_Machine_1fd030608d.png","srcSet":"/static/6424f1536b76c58a2d74eb67e64b8b8d/497c6/dream_Machine_1fd030608d.png 1x"}}}},"Gallery":[{"localFile":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"fullWidth","backgroundColor":"#280858","images":{"fallback":